  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  name: redis-server\n  version: \"8.10.2\"\n\npackage:\n  name: ${{ name|lower }}\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/redis/redis/releases/download/${{ version }}/redis-full.tar.gz\n  sha256: ae6973de9b6ad8e6cf21b1e764abccab59200689af6aabce10d4cf6bbb2e253f\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  skip: win\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n    - ${{ stdlib(\"c\") }}\n    - ${{ compiler(\"cxx\") }}\n    - pkg-config\n    - make\n    # for built-in modules\n    - cmake\n    - ${{ compiler('rust') }}\n    - cargo-bundle-licenses\n    # redisearch's src/CMakeLists.txt runs gen_command_info.py; readies' mk/main additionally\n    # gates the whole Makefile on `python3 -m pip --version`, so pip (not just python) is needed\n    - pip\n    # redistimeseries' bundled libevent ships no configure; its autogen.sh needs autoreconf\n    - autoconf\n    - automake\n    - libtool\n    # bindgen needs both libclang.so and clang's builtin headers, at one major version\n    - clang\n    - libclang\n  host:\n    - jemalloc\n    - openssl\n    # redisearch's src/geometry and src/util/hash both do find_package(Boost REQUIRED); header-only parts only\n    - libboost-headers\n\ntests:\n  - script:\n      - redis-cli --version\n      - redis-server --version\n  - package_contents:\n      files:\n        - lib/redis/modules/redisbloom.so\n        - lib/redis/modules/redisearch.so\n        - lib/redis/modules/redistimeseries.so\n        - lib/redis/modules/rejson.so\n\nabout:\n  license: SSPL-1.0 OR LicenseRef-RSALv2 OR AGPL-3.0-only\n  license_file:\n    - LICENSE.txt\n    - THIRDPARTY-redisjson.yml\n    - THIRDPARTY-redisearch.yml\n  summary: Advanced key-value cache and store\n  description: |\n    Redis is an in-memory database that persists on disk. The data model\n    is key-value, but many different kind of values are supported: Strings,\n    Lists, Sets, Sorted Sets, Hashes, Streams, HyperLogLogs, Bitmaps.\n  homepage: https://redis.io/\n  repository: https://github.com/redis/redis\n  documentation: https://redis.io/\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - xhochy\n    - SimonBoothroyd\n    - XhstormR\n",
